# t5 = t4 + GMR v52o NOSPEC fix (gpu_model_runner_v52n.py -> v52o.py;
#      ONLY file changed vs t4):
#   - v52e telemetry producer in sample_tokens async branch referenced
#     self.rejection_sampler bare — stock assigns it ONLY in spec mode,
#     so the FIRST nospec request killed both workers (AttributeError,
#     t3n loopdiff nost3n leg 01:10:40). Guard: _v52e_rs = getattr(self,
#     "rejection_sampler", None); spec-mode tuple values byte-identical
#     (t3n spec-lane evidence carries), nospec yields (None, logits,
#     None, None, None) tolerated by the v52e consumer try/except.
#   - scheduler 2dbe35a3... (comment amendment), GMR md5
#     a3cca4eb... -> d7fbc6f5..., all else byte-identical to t4/t3n.
